 type defined in OAuth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"2.0, Section 6."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:jwt-bearer”: The JWT Bearer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Token Grant Type defined in OAuth JWT Bearer Token Profiles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[RFC7523]."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:saml2-bearer”: The SAML 2.0"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Bearer Assertion Grant defined in OAuth SAML 2 Bearer Token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Profiles [RFC7522].","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the token endpoint is used in the grant type, the value of this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter MUST be the same as the value of the “grant_type”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter passed to the token endpoint defined in the grant type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"definition.  Authorization servers MAY allow for other values as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defined in the grant type extension process described in OAuth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"2.0, Section 4.5.  If omitted, the default behavior is that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client will use only the “authorization_code” Grant Type."}]}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Vernissage"}],"externalID":"s:16VernissageServer30RegisterOAuthClientResponseDtoV10grantTypesSayAA0d9GrantTypeG0OGvp","title":"grantTypes","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"grantTypes"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16VernissageServer17OAuthGran